<title>URUGUAY: Uruguayan Jan meat exports up 29 pct vs Jan '96.</title>
<headline>Uruguayan Jan meat exports up 29 pct vs Jan '96.</headline>
<dateline>MONTEVIDEO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguayan meat exports totaled 20,562 tonnes in January, 29 percent more than in the same month of 1996, the government's National Meat Statistics Institute reported Tuesday.</p>
<p>The sales garnered $37.1 million, up from $30 million in January last year.</p>
<p>Some 77 percent of January's sales were of beef, and 10 percent of sheep meat, the institute said.</p>
<p>((--Montevideo Newsroom +5982 92-0336))</p>
